# The refresh: Refresh when opening (On) starts it as Favorites opens, on a worker thread, one feed after the other; the bar
# says "Updating 3/6...", the feed in flight says so on its row. One feed fails (HTTP 503), one times out: their rows say why
# in the warn tone, the others are updated. Offline: every feed fails, "No network", the cached articles stay. Stop, and
# leaving the page, cancel it.
seed pin us-ars-technica
seed pin gb-bbc-news-top-stories
seed pin fr-korben
seed pin jp-nhk
seed pin us-lwn-net
seed pin int-hacker-news-front-page-hnrss
seed refresh_on_open on
wait 900
net slow 500
key enter
wait 700
expect state refreshing 1
shot 01-updating
check updating
wait 1100
shot 02-updating-more
wait 3500
expect state refreshing 0
expect state refresh 6/6
shot 03-updated-partial
check updated
key end
wait 300
expect text "Not updated: Server error (HTTP 503)"
expect text "Not updated: Timed out"
shot 03b-failed-rows
key home
net slow 0
# offline: Refresh all fails everywhere, the articles stay
net offline
tap "Refresh all"
wait 1500
expect state refreshing 0
shot 04-offline
expect text "Not updated: No network  ·  2 h"
expect text "Not updated: No network  ·  14 min"
net online
key ctrl-r
wait 1500
shot 05-online-again
# Stop on the bar
net slow 800
tap "Refresh all"
wait 300
expect state refreshing 1
expect text "Stop"
shot 06-stop-button
tap "Stop"
wait 1500
expect state refreshing 0
shot 07-stopped
# leaving the page cancels too
tap "Refresh all"
wait 300
key esc
wait 1500
expect state page home
expect state refreshing 0
shot 08-left-page
net slow 0
